fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"vulkanlib/vkutils.html#gst_vulkan_ensure_element_device","fragment":"\n\tgst_vulkan_ensure_element_device\n\n\n\tGstVulkan.prototype.vulkan_ensure_element_device\n\n\n\tGstVulkan.vulkan_ensure_element_device\n\nPerform the steps necessary for retrieving a GstVulkanDevice from\nthe surrounding elements or create a new device according to the device_id.\nIf the contents of device_ptr is not NULL, then no\nGstContext query is necessary and no GstVulkanDevice\nretrieval is performed.\nParameters:\na GstElement\nthe GstVulkanInstance\nthe resulting GstVulkanDevice\nThe device number to use, 0 is default.\nwhether a GstVulkanDevice exists in device_ptr\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nPerform the steps necessary for retrieving a GstVulkan.VulkanDevice from\nthe surrounding elements or create a new device according to the device_id.\nIf the contents of device_ptr is not null, then no\nGst.Context query is necessary and no GstVulkan.VulkanDevice\nretrieval is performed.\nParameters:\na Gst.Element\nthe GstVulkan.VulkanInstance\nthe resulting GstVulkan.VulkanDevice\nThe device number to use, 0 is default.\nReturns a tuple made of:\nwhether a GstVulkan.VulkanDevice exists in device_ptr\nwhether a GstVulkan.VulkanDevice exists in device_ptr\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\nPerform the steps necessary for retrieving a GstVulkan.VulkanDevice from\nthe surrounding elements or create a new device according to the device_id.\nIf the contents of device_ptr is not None, then no\nGst.Context query is necessary and no GstVulkan.VulkanDevice\nretrieval is performed.\nParameters:\na Gst.Element\nthe GstVulkan.VulkanInstance\nthe resulting GstVulkan.VulkanDevice\nThe device number to use, 0 is default.\nReturns a tuple made of:\nwhether a GstVulkan.VulkanDevice exists in device_ptr\nwhether a GstVulkan.VulkanDevice exists in device_ptr\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.26\n\t\t\n"});